se is a relationship between two moving things. Keep every existing regression and control passing and mutation-sensitive, including the citation exit-code fail-closed rule, the loss-of---local regression, the per-command environment isolation test and every vector test. Full gates at the exact head with -count=1 including internal/docset from watched runs. Then request independent review from codex citing the head, the artifacts and this request. Do not merge.","dead_basis_override":"true","to":"a6ac0d547ec6700408e435cb1cc54b9b546c379d2ac28e5528189b5d63592b84"}}